; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Peripheral.c	   873        Verify that:
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Peripheral.c	   874          1. Verify that each peripheral region in OsCfg_PeripheralRefs is no NULL_PTR,
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Peripheral.c	   875          2. the size of OsCfg_PeripheralRefs is equal OS_PERIPHERALID_COUNT + 1 and
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Peripheral.c	   876          3. each element in Os_PeripheralIdType has a value lower than OS_PERIPHERALID_COUNT.
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Peripheral.c	   877  
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Peripheral.c	   878  \CM CM_OS_PERIPHERALCHECK_N
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Peripheral.c	   879        Precondition ensures that the pointer is valid. The compliance of the precondition is check during review.
